# Frontend

- Poll frozen REST only. Do not invent API fields. No SSE.
- Prefer five-way `latest.label` on `GET /stations` for marker color (do not N+1 the 48). Weather is amber, never rose. Warming up is its own idle color.
- Five-page light console: Network (all 48, camera on Mumbai plus Safdarjung), Station, Alerts, Control (replay stories), Guide.
- Demo faults on the console go through `POST /demo/replay`. Do not call `inject.py` from Streamlit. Do not call port 8001.
- Raw observed series stay solid. Dashed correction and the 90% band appear only when `imputed_interval` is present.

See `docs/frontend.md` and `docs/contracts.md`.
